+
+| ID | Missing fact/evidence | Affected scope | Concrete write-back or owner question |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| F-01 | Runtime chapter premise/boundaries are not commissioned | All implementation | **Q-R4**. Owner reviews this proposal; if desired, explicitly commission this book-faithful scope with its placement and exclusions. Review of this documentation is not automatically a game/art/spend commission |
+| F-02 | Exact performers/takes for Rumi, Hana, Nari, Duri, imps, new Roshan lines and original songs | Required cues and accepted non-reader play | **Q-R2 / existing OQ-RUMI-RUNTIME-VOICE**. Who performs the chapter's exact cues/songs? Recommend a short exact cue/recording request through current approved voice process, preserving family sources; no new cloned identity. Record answer/take rights in canon, cue catalogue and voice ledger |
