+      "text": "| How does Fashion Designer fit the party and persistent play? | The owner-directed [Fashion Designer brief](../design/FASHION_DESIGNER_ROSHAN_2026-10-06.md) connects persistent recurring-character clothing and game-wide outfit unlocks with disguise dress-up activities. Roshan puts on her special dress before the party/Iko Iko/Ember King scene; this adds a scoped clothing beat alongside the eight-career spine without changing its bits or masks. Integrated alpha62389344 implements five-character clothing, additive saves, earned looks, a pre-party dress gate and later pictured practice. The owner correction2026-10-07 requires a shared Godot skin engine with preserved animation/design and repeatable dress-up for Roshan, Daddy and Rumi; its painted engine candidate passes exact Godot4.7.2 local82 probes and55 atlas comparisons, with published-head CI tracked separately. The next owner correction requires independent head/body/tail choices, removal of the redundant question mark and repeated figure, and more painted repo-themed clothing. Its [slot impact](../design/audit_impacts/fashion-slots-20261007.json) records 18 generated garments, two reused headpieces, 260 per-family layers and additive slot saves; focused actual GUI/animation/reload/geometry checks and the full local82 suite pass against frozen725 files. Published-head CI is tracked separately in the PR. Art/voice/device/child/owner acceptance remains pending; the later disguise mission remains unbound. See its committed runtime impact and the [illustrated process walkthrough](../assets_src/review/fashion_walkthrough_20261007/README.md): synthetic references and missing natural action/reload captures are explicit; the richer redesign is separately proposed and not yet playable. The 2026-10-25 owner-commissioned [beta expansion](../design/audit_impacts/fashion-beta-20261025.json) adds four painted sets (12 independent pieces; 156 additive layers), starter/earned choices and a six-card wardrobe with a larger single preview. Focused input/save, geometry controls and the complete local82-probe suite pass on 193 frozen runtime/source inputs; exact-head CI is tracked separately in the PR/Actions and impact. Full-pose art, phone/child/owner beta acceptance remains pending. |"
+    },
+    {
+      "sha256": "93efe0bc39292d641eab5df42be8e3cad08dd6542cd26842b9748fd94ebba12e",
+      "text": "Scoped Day One Grok Handoff 2: [footage audit](GROK_HANDOFF_2_FOOTAGE_AUDIT_2026-09-09.md), [protocol](../design/GROK_HANDOFF_2_CONTINUITY_PROTOCOL_2026-09-09.md), and [impact](../design/audit_impacts/grok-handoff-2-20260909.json). External motion-reference repairs do not close live visual findings or delivery gates."
+    }
+  ]
+}
