+## 4. Save and causal reconstruction
+
+Proposed additive semantic `rumi_world_*` namespace avoids assigning a chapter number. Names are not implemented schema; recheck collisions at implementation. Use existing typed director/main/SaveState seam, not another save file/singleton.
+
