+Each field above has the `rumi_world_` prefix. Normalize types/recognized semantic states, preserve unknown/future fields, old keys, `.bak`, outfits/medals/global masks/tombstones. Invalid raw state must not manufacture a win: recover a safe consistent visible checkpoint without destroying unknown raw progress. Future-schema data must not be overwritten by an older empty journal. Test primary/backup recovery and upgrade fixtures without touching the child's save. Replay uses transient state and never clears earned story milestones.
+
+Fresh-save acceptance starts at New Game and earns Day One/Chapter 2 prerequisites in the same trusted production-input traversal, then uses visible pool/room entrances and real live touches through R00–17. No post-boss fixture, mounted-room setup, director callback, override or probe-only gesture counts. Native restart/Continue checks cover each journal boundary, especially before/after loop removal, Duri clearance, hook tie, pop, solo start and home. Label fixture/config diagnostics separately. MA-PLAY-005 remains open.
