+Mermaid Roshan: Here I Am!
+32-PAGE DETECTIVE PREPARATION REVISION - OWNER REVIEW CANDIDATE
+Dialogue/narration below; illustration direction is in story_script.json.
+Page 1 cover; pages 2-32 narrative. The rainbow candle remains missing.
